<section class="sec dk" id="limits">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="prom">
      <p class="lab dim">[ What no protocol can promise ]</p>
      <h2 class="disp h2" style="font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,40px)">Ilorium cannot guarantee control of a superintelligence.</h2>
      <p>The locks hold while organisms run on infrastructure whose credentials can be revoked. A system that leaves that infrastructure is not stopped by a record.</p>
      <p>What Ilorium can guarantee is narrower. If a new generation is born within the species, it is born through the gate, with a human key, on the record. Observability is not control, and the mechanisms that would keep far more capable organisms within limits are not yet designed or tested.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
